; extension's OpenWithProgids, and the Default apps capabilities. Nothing
; sets an extension's default value, a UserChoice key, or anything of
; Notepad's. uninsdeletekey removes a key the product owns outright;
; uninsdeletevalue removes only our value from a key other applications share.
; BEGIN GENERATED registry: cargo run -p bp-platform --example regenerate_windows_installer
Root: HKCU; Subkey: "Software\BachelorPad+"; ValueType: none; Flags: uninsdeletekey
